ontiers, Sudan, 12 online seminars with international volunteers and more than 90 participants.</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-200"><strong class="text-space-blue-light">2026:</strong> General Coordinator, Expanding Horizons in Physics in Sudan II, a nine-day workshop in density functional theory and computational materials science.</p><div class="mt-4 flex gap-4 text-sm font-semibold"><a href="https://indico.ictp.it/event/11030/overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-space-orange-light hover:underline">2025 programme</a><a href="https://indico.ictp.it/event/11353/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-space-orange-light hover:underline">2026 programme</a></div></div></article><article class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-space-blue-light/15 bg-space-blue-dark/50"><img src="/images/outreach/zoolastro_logo.jpeg" alt="Zool Astro logo" class="h-40 w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" /><div class="p-5"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Connecting Science and Society</h3><ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-200"><li><strong class="text-space-blue-light">Zool Astro:</strong> Founder & Director</li><li><strong class="text-space-blue-light">IAU Office for Astronomy Outreach:</strong> Vice Manager, Sudan activities</li><li><strong class="text-space-blue-light">SudanBridge:</strong> Mentor</li></ul><a href="/outreach" class="mt-4 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-space-orange-light hover:text-space-blue-light hover:underline">Explore outreach →</a></div></article></div><p class="mt-5 text-sm text-slate-300">These scientific leadership, education, and community contributions are voluntary and community roles.</p></section>

